  "updatedAt": "2026-10-16T13:20:54.671163Z",
  "totalBlocks": 39,
  "translatedBlocks": 39,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb5a2e93c1cbb8b8",
      "translationZh": "今天，在 GTC Paris 上，我们很高兴地宣布与 NVIDIA 合作推出 Training Cluster as a Service，让世界各地的研究机构能够更轻松地获取大型 GPU 集群，从而在各个领域训练面向未来的基础模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "25f8e9a4f0634335",
      "translationZh": "让 GPU 集群触手可及",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fefb0d6337f4612",
      "translationZh": "许多吉瓦级 GPU 超级集群项目正在建设中，用于训练下一代 AI 模型。这可能让人觉得，“GPU 贫乏者”与“GPU 富有者”之间的算力差距正在迅速扩大。但 GPU 资源其实是存在的，因为超大规模云服务商、区域性云服务商以及 AI 原生云服务商都在迅速扩充容量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74516a47a02f362a",
      "translationZh": "那么，我们如何将 AI 算力资源与需要它们的研究人员连接起来？我们如何让世界各地的大学、国家研究实验室和公司能够构建自己的模型？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "152bd2e9d3964495",
      "translationZh": "这正是 Hugging Face 和 NVIDIA 通过 Training Cluster as a Service 着力解决的问题：让 GPU 集群更易于获取，并提供仅按训练运行时长付费的灵活性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ef14f1131d0f2da",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用，Hugging Face 上的 250,000 家组织中的任何一家，都可以在需要时申请所需规模的 GPU 集群。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "运作方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a72725be6b510d5",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用，你可以代表你的组织在 hf.co/training-cluster 申请 GPU 集群。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "819ec167ca529527",
      "translationZh": "Training Cluster as a Service 将 NVIDIA 和 Hugging Face 的关键组件整合为一套完整的解决方案：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25e0ed65d7f7f2fc",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Cloud Partners 在区域数据中心提供 NVIDIA Hopper 和 NVIDIA GB200 等最新 NVIDIA 加速计算资源的容量，所有资源均集中纳入 NVIDIA DGX Cloud",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0eb8cceadae3632b",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA DGX Cloud Lepton 今日在 GTC Paris 上发布，可让研究人员轻松访问为其配置的基础设施，并支持训练任务的调度与监控",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a4c93466be6ea034",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 的开发者资源和开源库让启动训练任务变得轻而易举。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "403d12cfd01e158b",
      "translationZh": "您的 GPU 集群申请一经接受，Hugging Face 和 NVIDIA 就会协作，根据您对规模、区域和使用时长的要求，为您的 GPU 集群寻找资源、定价、配置并完成设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7dabad5103220a4b",
      "translationZh": "集群的实际应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dc472b2fbcaaa902",
      "translationZh": "携手 TIGEM 推进罕见遗传病研究",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75ee6a9421e24571",
      "translationZh": "Telethon 基因组学与医学研究所（简称 TIGEM）是一家致力于理解罕见遗传病背后的分子机制并开发新疗法的研究中心。训练新的 AI 模型为预测致病变异的影响和药物重定位提供了一条新路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df6e29db4e3e725d",
      "translationZh": "AI 为研究罕见遗传病的病因和开发治疗方法提供了新途径，但我们的领域需要训练新的模型。Training Cluster as a Service 让我们能够在恰当的时间，轻松获取所需的 GPU 算力容量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45bd973cd88d9dcf",
      "translationZh": "—— Diego di Bernardo，TIGEM 基因组医学项目协调人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7729a516dc0d36fc",
      "translationZh": "携手 Numina 推进数学 AI 发展",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4f8b63b54647c1c",
      "translationZh": "Numina 是一家非营利组织，致力于构建代码和数据集均开放的数学推理 AI，并赢得了 2024 年 AIMO 进步奖。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7af5ae41679866ab",
      "translationZh": "我们的目标是为 Deepmind 的 AlphaProof 等顶尖闭源模型构建开放的替代方案，目前正朝着这一目标稳步推进。计算资源是我们当前的瓶颈——有了 Training Cluster as a Service，我们将能够实现目标！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d73ef330ad28d1d",
      "translationZh": "—— Yann Fleureau，Project Numina 联合创始人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c3d5b8cabb74a6ce",
      "translationZh": "携手 Mirror Physics 推进材料科学发展",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38bf7deae7e7b19f",
      "translationZh": "Mirror Physics 是一家初创公司，致力于为化学和材料科学打造前沿 AI 系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34a82a24734b265b",
      "translationZh": "我们正与 MACE 团队携手，突破 AI 在化学领域的应用极限。借助 Training Cluster as a Service，我们正在以前所未有的规模构建高保真化学模型。这将是该领域向前迈出的重要一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0176f6bcf1c0f01d",
      "translationZh": "—— Sam Walton Norwood，Mirror 首席执行官兼创始人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "87bb9f6c1758330f",
      "translationZh": "为多样化的 AI 研究提供动力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ad492524952555c",
      "translationZh": "Training Cluster as a Service 是 Hugging Face 与 NVIDIA 的一项全新合作，旨在让全球 AI 研究者群体更便捷地获取 AI 算力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c1d03bb3c838832",
      "translationZh": "要在各个领域和各种语言中构建下一代 AI 模型，获取大规模、高性能算力至关重要。Training Cluster as a Service 将为研究者和企业消除障碍，使其能够训练最先进的模型，并拓展 AI 的可能性边界。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7654bd1f8a6c6187",
      "translationZh": "—— Clément Delangue，Hugging Face 联合创始人兼首席执行官",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca3299ff0f5809a1",
      "translationZh": "将 DGX Cloud Lepton 与 Hugging Face 的 Training Cluster as a Service 集成，为开发者和研究者提供了一种无缝方式，可通过覆盖广泛的云服务提供商网络访问高性能 NVIDIA GPU。这项合作让 AI 研究者和组织能够在使用 Hugging Face 上熟悉的工具的同时，更轻松地扩展其 AI 训练工作负载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82a3c4cec89e1e33",
      "translationZh": "—— Alexis Bjorlin，NVIDIA DGX Cloud 副总裁",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2b2881703eab965c",
      "translationZh": "携手 NVIDIA，赋能 AI 构建者",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c390fd6766db780",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴与 NVIDIA 合作，为 Hugging Face 组织提供训练集群即服务——你今天就可以访问 hf.co/training-cluster 开始使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d68fcec737d3e64f",
      "translationZh": "今天，在 GTC Paris 上，NVIDIA 宣布了面向 Hugging Face 用户的多项新贡献，涵盖从智能体到机器人的各个领域！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9306da5ff1872d5",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA DGX Cloud Lepton 将欧洲开发者与全球 NVIDIA 计算生态系统连接起来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8f4dfa40feb389d",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA AI 客户现在可以通过 NIM 部署超过 100k 个 Hugging Face 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e127c4cd9a2a0939",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 用户可以使用 NVIDIA Cosmos Predict-2 构建定制的物理 AI 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "52667e808ccfbc48",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Isaac GR00T N1.5 登陆 Hugging Face，为人形机器人提供动力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
